===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl2=frusta}}

# A [[cone]] or [[pyramid]] whose [[tip]] has been [[truncated]] by a [[plane]] [[parallel]] to its [[base]].
# A region of a [[sphere]] delimited by two [[parallel]] [[plane]]s.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|area of a sphere}} [[zone]]

====Usage notes====
The spelling {{term|frustrum}} is erroneous,<ref>{{R:OED}}</ref> and is by incorrect analogy with {{term|frustrate}}, also of Latin origin.

